  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PA - Gender operationalisation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PA - Gender operationalisering</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A call-off of consulting services for producing a brief and operational guidelines for gender mainstreaming in energy contributions in Sub-Saharan Africa. The study will focus on the electrification sub-sector and in relation to the Power Africa project portfolio. The consultant will analyse gender aspects in electrification and produce a guide that complements Sida&apos;s Gender Tool Box.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett avrop av konsulttj&#xe4;nster f&#xf6;r framtagande av en brief och operationella guidelines p&#xe5; gender mainstreaming i energiinsatser i Afrika s&#xf6;der om Sahara. Studien kommer att fokusera p&#xe5; elektrifiering sub-sektor och i relation till Power Afrika projektportfolio. Konsulten kommer att analysera gender aspekter i elektrifiering samt producera en guide som kompletterar Sidas Gender Tool Box.</narrative>
  </description>
